{
  "name": "UL check 2 min scope FFT off",
  "description": "DIAGNOSTIC (2026-10-27): run with --fft off at the normal 0.2 s / 500k points to decide whether UL's 0.24 Vpp at 2963 rpm in 20261027_131853 (vs ~7-8 Vpp on 2026-10-20 at identical CHAN1 settings) is the scope's FFT decimation or the sensor/supply after the move to the B&O linear supply. 30 s rest, 60 s at speed, 30 s rest.",
